OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes into viral shop
OL,4,Ashutters where gran was hoisted into
OL,5,Athe air
OL,6,
OL,7,FA shop made famous when a grandmother
OL,8,Fgot caught on its shutter and was left
OL,9,Fdangling in the air has hit the
OL,10,Fheadlines again after a car crashed
OL,11,Fthrough the front of it.
OL,13,FThe Best-One shop in Tonteg, Rhondda
OL,14,FCynon Taf, caught the dramatic moment
OL,15,Fon CCTV when a Jaguar smashed through
OL,16,Fits doors after mounting bollards and
OL,17,Fcrashing into the shop's coffee
OL,18,Fmachine.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
