OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes into viral shop
OL,4,Ashutters where gran was hoisted into
OL,5,Athe air
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn March 2024, the shop went viral
OL,8,Fafter staff member Anne Hughes got
OL,9,Fcaught on the shutter while waiting for
OL,10,Fthe shop to open to start her shift.
OL,12,FAnne, who died in 2025, was left
OL,13,Fdangling 7ft (2.1 metres) in the air
OL,14,Fand shouting for the owner to help her,
OL,15,Fwith CCTV footage of the incident
OL,16,Fviewed tens of millions of times.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
